1O25qMqtditbCTb.jpg"},{"id":2181609,"name":"Guoqing Yuan","role":"铁匠 (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/secBy1dRsFAF7WcwwcW15uZUlKe.jpg"},{"id":4684601,"name":"海帆","role":"库克 (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c9yblYim5XM7L1zMWl4gbDRfLar.jpg"},{"id":4684604,"name":"胡艺","role":"长舌蝠 (voice)"},{"id":1496419,"name":"Huang Ying","role":"艾蕾娜 (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cchQTm4OdkjJ8g3GKcBdCfDmoJI.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Dragon Nest: L'alba dei guerrieri","overview":"La storia di Dragon Nest - L’alba dei guerrieri è ambientata nella terra tranquilla di Altera, abitata da umani ed elfi. Qui improvvisamente, liberati dalle Montagne Oscure, gruppi di belve feroci attaccano le pacifiche città degli umani: è il segnale del ritorno del Drago Nero che vuole la distruzione di Altera. Decenni di guerre hanno creato una profonda diffidenza tra Umani ed Elfi, ma ora una nuova un’alleanza è stata sancita per riportare la pace e un gruppo di coraggiosi guerrieri parte per una missione segreta verso le Montagne Oscure. Bisogna riportare indietro la potente gemma che riposa nel petto del Drago Nero prima che questo si risvegli e scateni la sua furia sul mondo di Altera?"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Dragon Nest: Warriors' Dawn","overview":"For years, the land of Altera has observed an uneasy peace between the humans, the elves, and the beasts who are loyal to the legendary Black Dragon. But when the dragon wakes from its hibernation, mobilizing a force of beasts to make war, a small band of humans and elves unite in a search for the secret road to the dragon’s lair."},{"language":"zh-CN","title":"龙之谷：破晓奇兵","overview":"不务正业的流浪少年兰伯特意外听到了邪恶的大黑龙手下魔族准备攻占阿尔特里亚大陆的情况，为了保护家乡他与魔物周旋被困，却被游侠巴尔纳救下，加入到了游侠杰兰特、阿尔杰塔（景甜 配音）的队伍中。精灵一族中的法师首领卡拉秋（夏梓桐 配音）也带着公主内尔文与弓箭手随从莉亚（徐娇 配音）前来邀请人类国王参战，面对魔物的入侵，他们和游侠队伍以及人类骑士贝斯柯德（胡歌 配音）组成了对付大黑龙的联盟。众人历经困难来到了大黑龙的巢穴，兰伯特与莉亚日久生情，但是他们却不知道杰兰特和阿尔杰塔，以及贝斯柯德各自带着不为人知的秘密……"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h8Ee1kQSQ3yZubNGoyoDuDsCf33.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6i29AyCu1aKAbzbmQITTmOF2cVb.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":257932,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h8Ee1kQSQ3yZubNGoyoDuDsCf33.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h8Ee1kQSQ3yZubNGoyoDuDsCf33.jpg","language":"it","width":600,"height":900},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h8Ee1kQSQ3yZubNGoyoDuDsCf33.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/h8Ee1kQSQ3yZubNGoyoDuDsCf33.jpg","language":"it","width":600,"height":900},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3tz2dRokmI4Znhi81ejVRpcEosk.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3tz2dRokmI4Znhi81ejVRpcEosk.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8fklM49dK7AZ3j8jgycxbRwECGa.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8fklM49dK7AZ3j8jgycxbRwECGa.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8fklM49dK7AZ3j8jgycxbRwECGa.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8fklM49dK7AZ3j8jgycxbRwECGa.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ujGAhzUA4boVIuoGO0oYq2BxmZ3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ujGAhzUA4boVIuoGO0oYq2BxmZ3.jpg","language":"en","width":845,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/npwmCgUwKs7Aw0vZOWwKZL2Y4e1.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/npwmCgUwKs7Aw0vZOWwKZL2Y4e1.jpg","language":"en"